s-&gt;r : saveCourse(course)
r.&gt;u : material ID and source locations, or error
u-&gt;f : reopen the selected course
f-&gt;s : getCourse(courseId)
s-&gt;r : loadCourse(courseId)
r.&gt;u : stored IDs, pages or line ranges
